<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Tixible collects, uses, and protects information from visitors to tixible.com."
  updated="July 2026"
>

<p>Tixible ("we," "us," "Tixible") respects your privacy. This policy explains what information tixible.com collects, why, and what rights you have over it. It applies to this website and, once launched, to Closure.</p>

<h2>What we collect</h2>
<p>We keep this to the minimum needed to run an early-stage company website:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Contact form and newsletter signup.</strong> If you use the contact form, it opens your own email client with a pre-filled message — your message is sent directly from your email account to ours, exactly like writing us an email yourself. We do not currently store form submissions in any database or third-party inbox tool. If you subscribe to the newsletter, your email address is stored by our email provider, Buttondown, solely to send you updates.</li>
  <li><strong>Analytics.</strong> We use Plausible Analytics, a privacy-focused tool that does not use cookies and does not track you across sites or devices. It reports aggregate numbers (like page views) that cannot be tied back to you individually.</li>
  <li><strong>Hosting logs.</strong> Our hosting provider (Vercel) may log standard technical information (IP address, browser type, timestamps) for security and reliability purposes, as is standard for any website.</li>
</ul>

<h2>What we don't do</h2>
<p>We don't sell your data. We don't run advertising trackers. We don't buy or combine your information with third-party data broker lists.</p>

<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>If you're in Nigeria, the EU/UK, or anywhere else with data protection law, you have the right to ask what information we hold about you, correct it, ask us to delete it, or object to how it's used. Since we don't maintain a database of visitor information beyond your newsletter subscription, in most cases this simply means unsubscribing (link in every email) or asking us to remove your email from our list.</p>
<p>To exercise any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:hello@tixible.com">hello@tixible.com</a>.</p>

<h2>Data retention</h2>
<p>Newsletter subscriber emails are kept until you unsubscribe or ask us to delete them. Contact form messages, once sent to our inbox by your email client, are retained as normal email correspondence and deleted when no longer needed.</p>

<h2>International visitors</h2>
<p>Tixible is based in Abuja, Nigeria. Our hosting and analytics providers may process data on servers outside Nigeria. Where that applies, we rely on those providers' own compliance frameworks (e.g. standard contractual clauses for EU data).</p>

<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>As Tixible and Closure grow, this policy will be updated — particularly if we add analytics tools that use cookies (see our <a href="/legal/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>). We'll update the "last updated" date above whenever that happens.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:hello@tixible.com">hello@tixible.com</a>.</p>

</LegalLayout>
